        <mxCell id="sn1b" value="Boot = RAID-1 on &lt;b&gt;AVAGO 3108 MegaRAID&lt;/b&gt; (do not reconfigure). Data pools use a separate &lt;b&gt;LSI 9207-8e&lt;/b&gt; (IT mode) + multipath to the DS4246. JBOD may reset on reboot — re-run storcli64 set jbod=on. Original 3108 slot is DEAD; do not reuse." style="text;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#B8860B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
