        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sn2b" value="The VLAN 30 migration silently repointed PBS storage to .30.187 and broke all pve-node (VLAN 1) backups 07-02 → 07-06. Keep &lt;b&gt;randy-pbs on .10.187&lt;/b&gt; (reachable by every node); only the GPU/storage nodes use the .30.187 10G path." style="text;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#B8860B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
